3. Bundled from another repository of the same author
-----------------------------------------------------

  mods/attention-picker/           the "Agents waiting" dialog

  A bundled, unmodified copy of the mod of the same name in the herdr-agents-waiting repository (Apache License 2.0,
  same copyright holder). It is kept in sync from there; edit it there, not here. If you already have that mod
  installed, keep yours.


4. Original to this repository
------------------------------

Everything else (mods/portrait-tree, mods/bar-strip, mods/nvim-float, the code changes listed above, RECIPE.md,
keys.json, snippets/, scripts/, the preview and the layout thumbnails, which show invented content) is original work
under the Apache License 2.0.

Space and agent names, folders and notes that appear in the preview are made up.


5. Not included
---------------

No theme is shipped. The layouts take the colors of whatever theme the person has chosen. Fonts are the ones Herdr
ships (Geist, JetBrains Mono); no font files are included.

The logo of Obsidian is not used or redistributed anywhere in this repository.
